quires every wizard step and the add sheet in both themes at 100%/200%, with keyboard traversal on each step. C43-N03 instead requires exactly eight layout rows covering only add-mode Tenant and Verify, plus one Tenant keyboard walk. The retained first-run composites cover both themes at ordinary zoom but do not close the missing 200% and keyboard coverage. Extend and execute the replacement matrix for all required steps/modes; acceptance requires hash-bound captures, AX trees and traversal results for the complete matrix.\"\n  ],\n  \"blockers\": [],\n  \"evidence_gaps\": [\n    \"E1 — docs/planning/evidence/C44/native/cumulative/C43/native-acceptance.json does not establish the retained native behavior assertions identified in R1. The historical C29 record covers the earlier presentation; it does not supply native acceptance of those interactions after the C43 re-port. These assertions are marked exercised, not retired.\",\n    \"E2 — Current-presentation evidence for the complete C29-N06/T09 matrix is missing. The mapped C43-N03 record explicitly limits its layouts to add-mode Tenant and Verify. Passing component tests and historical screenshots cannot substitute for the required native matrix.\"\n  ],\n  \"optional_suggestions\": [],\n  \"limitations\": [\n    \"Reproduced all four supplied fingerprints. All 444 scoped file hashes and 18,337 compiled-input inventory entries matched, including the final recheck. Before/after inventories were identical; all 18 listed run-log hashes matched. These checks establish consistency under the supplied hashing procedures, not compiler or evidence authorship.\",\n    \"Verified C28's receipt hash and matching passing raw verdict; also checked C27's passing verdict against its receipt. D058 authorizes proceeding while C26 remains open; controller completion and the P09 phase gate remain separate.\",\n    \"Independently ran the retained onboarding binary: 10/10 passed; the retained IPC setup secret-confinement test: 1/1 passed; and the two offline L19 settlement regressions: 2/2 passed. The Rust binaries were not rebuilt or independently authenticated against compiler inputs. Broader results rely on retained logs, including 541 desktop tests and the recorded core, host, controller and build checks.\",\n    \"The L19 receipt and retained AX tree support successful management verification, with the placeholder scan key reported Stored. Verified the live receipt/build hash chain and current qualification executable hash. Recomputed the qualification-to-current source differences: the ten disclosed Harness/tooling files differ; scoped wizard/core/host/contracts inputs match. No live operation was independently repeated, and HTTP request counts were not observed.\",\n    \"The mapped C43 record matches its originating C44 preparation hash. All 52 scoped application/core/contracts files checked against C44's compiled-input inventory matched. The historical C44 executable has been replaced at its bundle path; the current executable matches P09's preparation, not the older C43 acceptance. Native conclusions therefore rely on retained records, AX trees and captures.\",\n    \"Inspected the retained wizard AX trees and three representative captures. Did not drive native UI, record spoken VoiceOver, exercise hosted Academy sign-in, inspect private authorization manifests or access credentials. Repository-recorded owner authorization was not independently authenticated.\",\n    \"No application files were changed, product endpoints called or OS permissions granted. The sandbox is read-only; this returned JSON must be persisted as the verdict artifact.\"\n  ],\n  \"inspected_files\": [\n    \"AGENTS.md\",\n    \"GLOSSARY.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0001-native-operation-authority.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0002-academy-shared-presentation.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0003-native-harness-and-scoped-identity.md\",\n    \"docs/adr/0004-managed-workbench-admission.md\",\n    \"docs/planning/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md\",\n  